== Versos sobre la Carga 75
#linebreak()
#text()[ [Ha꜓nda mayaṁ bhāra-su꜕tta-gāthā꜓yo bha꜕ṇāmase] ]
#linebreak()
#text()[ Bhārā ha꜕ve pañcakkha꜓ndhā bhāra-hāro ca pu꜓gga꜕lo ]
#linebreak()
#text()[ Bhā꜕r’ādānaṁ du꜕kkhaṁ loke꜓ bhāra-nikkhe꜓pa꜕naṁ su꜕khaṁ ]
