#linebreak()
#text()[ Dhammo ha꜕ve rakkha꜕ti꜕ dhamma꜓-cāriṁ ]
#linebreak()
#text()[ Dhammo su꜕ciṇṇo su꜕kham-āvahāti ]
#linebreak()
#text()[ Esā꜓ni꜕saṁso dhamme su꜕ciṇṇe ]
