Los Versos de Tāyana 111
#linebreak()
#text()[ [Handa mayaṁ tāyana-gāthāyo bhaṇāmase] ]
#linebreak()
#text()[ Chi꜓nda so꜕taṁ pa꜕rakkamma kā꜕me panūda brā꜓hm꜕aṇa ]
